1
00:00:01,866 --> 00:00:02,866
Maybe I forgot

2
00:00:03,533 --> 00:00:04,200
Forgot

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:05,333
Boss

4
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:06,933
I've been too tired these days

5
00:00:07,233 --> 00:00:07,966
Mixing the feed

6
00:00:07,966 --> 00:00:08,533
Feeding them

7
00:00:08,533 --> 00:00:09,333
Checking the water temperature

8
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:10,933
Doing the work of three people

9
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,040
Isn't it normal to forget

10
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:12,600
a couple of times

11
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:13,833
Anyway these little beasts

12
00:00:13,866 --> 00:00:14,866
Won't die from starving for a couple days

13
00:00:15,066 --> 00:00:15,966
What kind of attitude is that

14
00:00:16,333 --> 00:00:17,833
Can't you tell my attitude

15
00:00:18,433 --> 00:00:18,866
Boss

16
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,733
I've been at this farm for a while now

17
00:00:21,033 --> 00:00:22,424
Mixing feeding checking temperature

18
00:00:22,424 --> 00:00:23,033
and logging data

19
00:00:23,033 --> 00:00:24,500
I do all this work by myself

20
00:00:24,933 --> 00:00:25,800
To be brutally honest

21
00:00:25,833 --> 00:00:26,600
The reason these frogs

22
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,166
are doing so well

23
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:28,533
Is all thanks to me Jason

24
00:00:33,733 --> 00:00:34,800
To tell you the truth

25
00:00:35,633 --> 00:00:36,966
Daniel across the street said

26
00:00:37,433 --> 00:00:38,641
He offered me 30000 a month

27
00:00:38,641 --> 00:00:39,300
to work for him

28
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,133
30000

29
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,133
That's three times what you pay me

30
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,100
Let me be clear today

31
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:46,900
Either you raise my salary

32
00:00:47,266 --> 00:00:47,733
To 30000

33
00:00:47,933 --> 00:00:48,866
Not a penny less

34
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:50,333
Or I leave right now

35
00:00:50,933 --> 00:00:51,933
Suit yourself

36
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:53,500
The salary I give you

37
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:54,966
Is already the highest in the industry

38
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:57,166
Then there's nothing more to say

39
00:00:57,533 --> 00:00:58,266
All your skills

40
00:00:58,300 --> 00:00:59,100
I taught you myself

41
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,600
And based on your current work

42
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:01,633
It's not worth 30000

43
00:01:02,066 --> 00:01:02,966
If Daniel is offering you that much

44
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,100
He definitely has an ulterior motive

45
00:01:04,133 --> 00:01:05,433
Careful not to end up empty-handed

46
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:08,333
You just can't stand to see me do well

47
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:19,533
Why are you packing Jason

48
00:01:19,533 --> 00:01:20,066
I quit

49
00:01:20,066 --> 00:01:20,700
Lewes

50
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,233
You just got lucky

51
00:01:22,233 --> 00:01:22,933
Becoming the boss

52
00:01:23,633 --> 00:01:24,652
What gives you the right

53
00:01:24,652 --> 00:01:25,366
to look down on me

54
00:01:26,133 --> 00:01:27,200
You're making my life miserable

55
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:28,666
So I'll make yours miserable too

56
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:29,666
I'm going across the street

57
00:01:29,666 --> 00:01:30,900
To work at Boss Daniel's farm

58
00:01:35,533 --> 00:01:36,166
Why

59
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,866
Boss Lewes pays pretty well here

60
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:39,000
And pays social security

61
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:40,733
Other places only pay two or three thousand

62
00:01:40,733 --> 00:01:41,633
With no insurance

63
00:01:41,666 --> 00:01:42,266
Yeah

64
00:01:42,666 --> 00:01:44,266
Boss Lewes helped us all out

65
00:01:44,666 --> 00:01:45,566
The food here is good too

66
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:46,466
Meat at every meal

67
00:01:46,833 --> 00:01:47,800
When it's not busy we get to rest

68
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:48,533
And he doesn't say anything

69
00:01:48,833 --> 00:01:49,700
He's a very good boss

70
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,266
You've all been tricked by him
